  "outcome": "not-supported",
  "finding": "All660short settings completed;7received complete-page source decoding and none cleared strict>-5.5. Best returned full score -6.994514123971474. Separately frozen post-target audit independently reconstructs all1220retained hypotheses; all7settings improve under normalization but none crosses the gate, best -6.944792840501962. All112plants contain skips and pass gates;98recover exactly, with14labels repeating one scorer-preference situation.",
  "limitations": "112array controls repeat only eight step/reading structures. All14nonexact controls retain the true reading second in the final beam. Source cumulative ranking differs from normalized acceptance.330Atbash-off rigid settings overlap prior progressive Caesar; that record does not demonstrate the330reflected rigid forms. Only strict short survivors were fully decoded; no plaintext, full-search probability, page-number significance or general key-family negative.",
  "next_steps": "A different proposal needs a fixed assignment, clock and skip law with relevant complete-reading controls and a prospective complete-search calibration.",
